//! Every setting this facade reads, and the operator table rendered from
//! them.
//!
//! Each crate declares its settings once, in a [`settings!`](crate::settings!)
//! block. [`all`] gathers the rows of every library crate the facade links;
//! a host adds its own ([`crate::SpiiceApp::settings`]) and renders the
//! table with [`markdown_table`]. `docs/configuration.md` is that table for
//! the canonical host, regenerated by a test in `apps/proxiima-mcp`.

